                  SpatialCoordinates d → ℝ) y) ^ 2) ≤
              C * U N om * r ^ (t0 - eta) *
                ((∫ y in (unitNeumannCube d : Set (SpatialCoordinates d)) ∩
                    (unitNeumannCube d : Set (SpatialCoordinates d)),
