      Cp Bst N hq hpq ht_nn hCm.le hCmic.le hCp.le hBst (U N) (V N) (Dx N) (Mx N) (hW N).1 (hW N).2
      (hmem N).1.aestronglyMeasurable (hSm N).aestronglyMeasurable (hstatM N).1 (hstatM N).2, ?_⟩
  filter_upwards [hae, heae] with om hω1 hω2
